Name: Fuse.js
URL: https://fusejs.io
Version: 6.4.1
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: src/LICENSE
License Android Compatible: yes
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Description:
Fuzzy search js library used by WebUI
Local Modifications:
Added the file README.chromium (this file)

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
copy.bara.sky lists every file it imports. If the new upstream version adds a
file Chromium needs, add it there and to
chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/emoji_picker/BUILD.gn.
